--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The device configuration dataset shipped with Veneer (crates/veneer/data/) describes
aggregate hardware and software characteristics such as operating system,
browser version, GPU strings, screen classes, font lists, locales and
timezones. It contains no personal data: no IP addresses, account identifiers,
cookies, browsing history, or any value that identifies an individual.

Each data source and its license is recorded in crates/veneer/data/SOURCES.md. Data that
cannot be redistributed under terms compatible with the MIT License is not
accepted into the repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Veneer depends on third-party Rust crates and npm packages, each distributed
under its own license. Their license texts are bundled with release artifacts
and can be listed from source with:

    cargo about generate about.hbs
    npx license-checker --production

